        <body>
            <div xml:id="d777">

                <pb facs="1249" n="1153" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1153"/>

                <head>No. 774.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodenow to Mr Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-03-18"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 18, 1874</date>.
                        (Received April 10.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Herewith. I have the honor to transmit an
                    abridgment of the final report of the international tonnage commission, held at
                    Constantinople, in 1873, which I cat from yesterday’s issue of the Levant
                    Herald. The report has not been officially communicated to this legation.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. H. GOODENOW.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d777-a1.xml" xpointer="d777-a1"/>
            </div>
